# Real, unredacted exports (see /local-data and .gitignore). The backend image
# COPYs only `prompts/` and `finreport-rs/`, so nothing here reaches it today,
# and the frontend builds from the `finreport-fe/` context, which excludes this
# path entirely. Listed anyway for two reasons: the directory is still part of
# the backend build context, so its contents are uploaded to the Docker daemon
# and cached there for no benefit; and the day someone adds a `COPY . .` to the
# backend Dockerfile, personal bank data would be baked into a published image
# with nothing to stop it.
local-data/
